{"t":"Stone of Insight","s":"stone-of-insight-6c847","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Stone_of_Insight_33ea11.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Stone of Insight</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Stone of Insight\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_of_Insight_33ea11.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Items<br/>Magical Items<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.99 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">? gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lightcolor\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Light</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"colorbox\" style=\"background-color: #cc66ff; width: 1em; height: 1em; display: inline-block;\"></span><span style=\"margin: 0 0 0 0.4em;\">4 sqm</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.52<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">August 12, 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20140811155832&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_of_Insight_33ea11.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a stone of insight.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 9.99 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">This rare artefact can be traded with Milos or Trimegis for a fraction of their knowledge.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This stone is a replacement for its old version, the Stone of Wisdom. By handing this stone to <a href=\"#/wiki/Milos\">Milos</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33258,31823,3\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33258, 31823, 3)</a>) or <a href=\"#/wiki/Trimegis\">Trimegis</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32307,32187,5\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32307, 32187, 5)</a>) you will receive experience equivalent to 100 times your level multiplied by your level.\n</p><p><span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\"><math alttext=\"{\\displaystyle {Exp} = 100\\,\\times\\,{(Level)}^2}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mi>E</mi>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mi>p</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>100</mn>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mo>×<!-- × --></mo>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<msup>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>L</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>l</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n<mn>2</mn>\n</msup>\n</mstyle>\n</mrow>\n<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle {Exp} = 100\\,\\times\\,{(Level)}^2}</annotation>\n</semantics>\n</math></span></span>\n</p><p>You can only use one stone per year per character and only when the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a> event is active (September 01–07) or before <a href=\"#/wiki/Server%20Save\">server save</a> on September 30th, if your server successfully finished the event.\n</p><p>In case you want to know the experience difference gained from a level and another one (in case you decide to use the stone at the end of month to earn some extra experience), you can use the following formula:\n</p><p><span class=\"mwe-math-element\"><span class=\"mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y\"><math alttext=\"{\\displaystyle {ExpDiff}=200\\,\\times \\,{(CurrentLevel)}\\,\\times \\,{(LevelsGained)}\\,+\\,100\\,\\times \\,{(LevelsGained)}\\,\\times {(LevelsGained)}}\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\">\n<semantics>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\">\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mi>E</mi>\n<mi>x</mi>\n<mi>p</mi>\n<mi>D</mi>\n<mi>i</mi>\n<mi>f</mi>\n<mi>f</mi>\n</mrow>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mn>200</mn>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mo>×<!-- × --></mo>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>C</mi>\n<mi>u</mi>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mi>r</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>n</mi>\n<mi>t</mi>\n<mi>L</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>l</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mo>×<!-- × --></mo>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>L</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>l</mi>\n<mi>s</mi>\n<mi>G</mi>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mi>i</mi>\n<mi>n</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>d</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mo>+</mo>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mn>100</mn>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mo>×<!-- × --></mo>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>L</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>l</mi>\n<mi>s</mi>\n<mi>G</mi>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mi>i</mi>\n<mi>n</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>d</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n<mspace width=\"thinmathspace\"></mspace>\n<mo>×<!-- × --></mo>\n<mrow class=\"MJX-TeXAtom-ORD\">\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo>\n<mi>L</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>v</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>l</mi>\n<mi>s</mi>\n<mi>G</mi>\n<mi>a</mi>\n<mi>i</mi>\n<mi>n</mi>\n<mi>e</mi>\n<mi>d</mi>\n<mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo>\n</mrow>\n</mstyle>\n</mrow>\n<annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">{\\displaystyle {ExpDiff}=200\\,\\times \\,{(CurrentLevel)}\\,\\times \\,{(LevelsGained)}\\,+\\,100\\,\\times \\,{(LevelsGained)}\\,\\times {(LevelsGained)}}</annotation>\n</semantics>\n</math></span></span>\n</p><p>Reward of the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quest</a>, for characters who damaged <a href=\"#/wiki/Devovorga\">Devovorga</a> or one of its incarnations (<a href=\"#/wiki/Anmothra\">Anmothra</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Irahsae\">Irahsae</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Teneshpar\">Teneshpar</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Chikhaton\">Chikhaton</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Phrodomo\">Phrodomo</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li>Extra Slot</li><li>Light Sources</li><li>Magical Items</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milos\">Milos</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Quest%20Items\">Quest Items</a></li><li>Repeatable Tasks</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a></li><li>Stone of Wisdom</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quests</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["rise-of-devovorga"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"rise-of-devovorga","quest":"Rise of Devovorga","step":"3-1","n":15,"title":"Abrir os baús","kind":"reward","coords":[]}],"spots":[{"x":33258,"y":31823,"z":3,"text":"This stone is a replacement for its old version, the Stone of Wisdom . By handing this stone to Milos ( here ) or Trimegis ( here ) you will receive experience equivalent to 100 times your level multiplied by your level."},{"x":32307,"y":32187,"z":5,"text":"This stone is a replacement for its old version, the Stone of Wisdom . By handing this stone to Milos ( here ) or Trimegis ( here ) you will receive experience equivalent to 100 times your level multiplied by your level."}]}}